@acl = http://localhost:6000
@legacy = http://localhost:6050

### Przez ACL - czysty JSON
GET {{acl}}/demo/acl/invoice/12345

### Przez ACL - losowe invoiceId (15% failure rate)
GET {{acl}}/demo/acl/invoice/1234

### Bezposrednio do Legacy SOAP (brzydki XML)
POST {{legacy}}/soap/billing/GetInvoice
Content-Type: text/xml

<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetInvoiceRequest xmlns="http://legacy.billing.corp/2005">
      <INV_ID>12345</INV_ID>
    </GetInvoiceRequest>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Legacy - info endpoint
GET {{legacy}}/

### Legacy - health check
GET {{legacy}}/soap/billing/health
